{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-daily-conversation-on-natural-everyday-topics-write-like-you-are-talkin/audio/main-c8e4e1c904ea.mp3","durationSec":156.528,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.56,"text":"Small talk is polite, friendly talk about simple things."},{"start":4.16,"end":10.2,"text":"People use daily conversation on natural everyday topics like weather, food, and weekend plans."},{"start":11.06,"end":12.78,"text":"The subject does not need to be important."},{"start":13.38,"end":14.84,"text":"The friendly contact matters."},{"start":15.66,"end":17.54,"text":"Small talk often starts with a greeting."},{"start":18.3,"end":21.56,"text":"Then people talk a little, and finally they end the conversation."},{"start":22.5,"end":24.4,"text":"Think of two people meeting outside a shop."},{"start":24.82,"end":27.94,"text":"They say hello, talk about the rain, and say goodbye."},{"start":28.58,"end":32.12,"text":"They have not shared big news, but they have shared a friendly moment."},{"start":33.2,"end":36.26,"text":"Weather means what the air and sky are like at a particular time."},{"start":36.8,"end":39.56,"text":"It can be hot, cold, wet, or windy."},{"start":40.06,"end":43.9,"text":"People often begin small talk with rain, sun, or the temperature."},{"start":45.04,"end":47.68,"text":"Weather talk can be about something happening right now."},{"start":48.56,"end":51.74,"text":"Two people outside a school might both notice the strong wind."},{"start":52.22,"end":56.68,"text":"Their talk can also be about a change, such as a cold morning after a warm day."},{"start":57.3,"end":61.54,"text":"The subject is simple, but it gives them something from daily life to share."},{"start":61.54,"end":66.14,"text":"Food talk often starts with something people ate or something they like."},{"start":66.84,"end":68.76,"text":"It can also be about a simple local dish."},{"start":69.52,"end":72.24,"text":"A style of cooking is often linked to a place or culture."},{"start":72.9,"end":75.78,"text":"It includes the foods people use and the ways they cook them."},{"start":76.78,"end":79.4,"text":"Everyday food talk can stay much simpler than that."},{"start":79.76,"end":83.1,"text":"For example, someone can describe a warm bowl of soup at lunch."},{"start":83.84,"end":85.86,"text":"Another person can talk about their own lunch."},{"start":86.4,"end":89.94,"text":"A small detail about a meal gives the conversation something to follow."},{"start":89.94,"end":94.54,"text":"A school day or work day gives people more everyday things to talk about."},{"start":95.16,"end":97.7,"text":"School talk can include morning classes and homework."},{"start":98.46,"end":101.6,"text":"Work talk can stay light, with a little news about a busy day."},{"start":101.6,"end":103.94,"text":"Plans are another common subject."},{"start":104.98,"end":108.12,"text":"Most countries have a five-day workweek and a two-day weekend."},{"start":108.82,"end":112.88,"text":"In many places, the weekend is Saturday and Sunday, but not everywhere."},{"start":113.68,"end":116.22,"text":"People often talk about their weekend plans."},{"start":116.82,"end":121.78,"text":"A quiet day at home is still a plan, so this talk does not need exciting news."},{"start":122.76,"end":126.96,"text":"A cafe serves coffee drinks, and some cafes also serve light snacks."},{"start":127.7,"end":129.44,"text":"It can be a place to meet and talk."},{"start":130.5,"end":134.32,"text":"A convenience store is a small shop selling many everyday items."},{"start":135.04,"end":139.14,"text":"In the United Kingdom, people often call this kind of place a corner shop."},{"start":139.78,"end":142.58,"text":"These places bring daily topics together."},{"start":142.58,"end":146.46,"text":"Cafe talk might be about food or weekend plans."},{"start":147.16,"end":151.54,"text":"A short talk in a shop might be about the line, a purchase, or rain outside."},{"start":152.3,"end":156.04,"text":"Again, the subject can be small while the contact stays friendly."}],"words":[{"text":"Small","start":0,"end":0.3},{"text":"talk","start":0.3,"end":0.54},{"text":"is","start":0.54,"end":0.76},{"text":"polite","start":0.76,"end":1.22},{"text":"friendly","start":1.7,"end":1.86},{"text":"talk","start":1.86,"end":2.34},{"text":"about","start":2.34,"end":2.7},{"text":"simple","start":2.7,"end":3.1},{"text":"things","start":3.1,"end":3.56},{"text":"People","start":4.16,"end":4.32},{"text":"use","start":4.32,"end":4.62},{"text":"daily","start":4.62,"end":4.9},{"text":"conversation","start":4.9,"end":5.44},{"text":"on","start":5.44,"end":5.8},{"text":"natural","start":5.8,"end":6.34},{"text":"everyday","start":6.34,"end":6.66},{"text":"topics","start":6.66,"end":7.3},{"text":"like","start":7.56,"end":7.76},{"text":"weather","start":7.76,"end":8.14},{"text":"food","start":8.64,"end":8.92},{"text":"and","start":9.26,"end":9.4},{"text":"weekend","start":9.4,"end":9.74},{"text":"plans","start":9.74,"end":10.2},{"text":"The","start":11.06,"end":11.14},{"text":"subject","start":11.14,"end":11.48},{"text":"does","start":11.48,"end":11.72},{"text":"not","start":11.72,"end":11.98},{"text":"need","start":11.98,"end":12.18},{"text":"to","start":12.18,"end":12.28},{"text":"be","start":12.28,"end":12.4},{"text":"important","start":12.4,"end":12.78},{"text":"The","start":13.38,"end":13.5},{"text":"friendly","start":13.5,"end":13.8},{"text":"contact","start":13.8,"end":14.36},{"text":"matters","start":14.36,"end":14.84},{"text":"Small","start":15.66,"end":16},{"text":"talk","start":16,"end":16.32},{"text":"often","start":16.32,"end":16.66},{"text":"starts","start":16.66,"end":16.98},{"text":"with","start":16.98,"end":17.18},{"text":"a","start":17.18,"end":17.32},{"text":"greeting","start":17.32,"end":17.54},{"text":"Then","start":18.3,"end":18.44},{"text":"people","start":18.44,"end":18.66},{"text":"talk","start":18.66,"end":18.96},{"text":"a","start":18.96,"end":19